  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M.M. Yacoob vs State Of Kerala on 1 September, 2014 Author: A.Muhamed Mustaque Bench: A.Muhamed Mustaque In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present: The Honourable Mr. Justice A.Muhamed Mustaque Monday, The 26Th Dayof October 2015/4Th Karthika, 1937 WP(C).No. 1182 of 2015 (W) --------------------------- Petitioner(S): -------------------------- M.M. Yacoob, S/O. Mohammed Ibrahim, Aged 60 Years, Cra 74-B, Sulthana, Vazhottukonam, Vattiyoorkavu P.O., Thiruvananthapuram - 13. By Smt.Sumathy Dandapani, Senior Advocate. Advs. Sri.Millu Dandapani, Sri.Premchand R.Nair. Respondent(S): ---------------------------- 1. State Of Kerala, Represented By The Secretary, Local Self Administration Department, Government Secretariat,Thiruvananthapuram - 65 001. 2 . The District Collector, Collectorate, Civil Station Building, Kudappanakunnu, Thiruvananthapuram - 695 005. 3. The State Police Chief, Kerala State, Vazhuthacadu, Thiruvananthapuram - 695 014. 4. The Circle Inspector Of Police, Museum Circle, Thiruvananthapuram - 695 033. 5. The Station House Officer, M.M. Yacoob vs State Of Kerala on 1 September, 2014 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/124813528/ 1 Museum Police Station, Thiruvananthapuram - 695 033. 6. The Corporation Of Thiruvananthapuram, Represented By Its Secretary, Thiruvananthapuram - 675 033. WP(C).No. 1182 of 2015 (W) 7. The Executive Engineer, Ped Roads Division, Public Works Department, Thiruvananthapuram - 695 033. 8. J. Deepa, D/O. Late Stephen, Tc No. 12/800, Barton Hill, Kunnukuzhy, Thiruvananthapuram - 695 033. 9. S. Rajan, Tc 49/503(18), Konchiravila, Manacaud P.O., Thiruvananthapuram - 695 009. R1 To R5 & R7 By Sr. Govt. Pleader Sri.Gikku Jacob. R6 By Sri.N.Nandakumara Menon, Senior Sc. Adv. Sri.P.K.Manojkumar, Sc. R8 & R9 By Adv. Sri.D.Kishore. This Writ Petition (Civil) Having Been Finally Heard On 26-10-2015, Along With Wp(C).No.18787 Of 2015, The Court On The Same Day Delivered The Following: rs. WP(C).No. 1182 of 2015 (W) Appendix Petitioner'S Exhibits:- P1 - True Copy Of The No Objection Certificate Dtd. 30.10.1985 Issued By The Executive Engineer, B&R Division, Trivandrum To The Commissioner, Corporation Of Trivandrum. P2 - True Copy Of The Receipt No. 01/11307106786 Dtd. 05.02.2014 For Payment Of License Fee For The Year 2014-15 In Respect Of Bunk No. 407 Of The Petitioner Issued By The 6Th Respondent Corporation.",
    "facts": "These writ petitions are filed at the instance of the same petitioner, in connection with operation of a mobile Icecream unit by one J.Deepa. . The other party respondent in both the writ petitions appears to be the person engaged by J.Deepa. W.P. (C).No.1182 of 2015 is filed alleging that J.Deepa is causing nuisance to the petitioner by placing the mobile Icecream unit in front of the petitioner's bunk, which is a no parking area. And further that on account of placing the mobile Icecream unit, his business is being affected. W.P.(C).No.18787 of 2015 is filed to take action against J.Deepa for violation of the terms and conditions of Ext.P8 licence issued by the Corporation.",
    "arguments": "",
